| Hardware Platform | Xilinx FPGA |
| Quantization | INT8 |
| Model Architecture | Residual CNN |
| Runtime | DPU Execution |
| Evaluation | PSNR / SSIM |
| Environment | Docker |
| Language | Python 3.10 |

