# 💻 Software Inference

The software inference pipeline:

- Loads the trained Residual CNN model
- Processes degraded PNG images
- Generates enhanced outputs automatically
- Saves inference results into the output directory

### Input Directory

```text
testing_images/degraded/
```

### Output Directory

```text
output/
```

### Software Model

```text
models/best_model_arch1.pth
```

---

# 🔌 FPGA Deployment

The repository also includes the FPGA deployment artifact:

```text
models/model_b8_c128_int.xmodel
```

This model is compiled using the Vitis AI quantization and deployment workflow for FPGA DPU execution.

Deployment features include:

- FPGA inference execution
- Runtime FPS benchmarking
- USB-based deployment workflow
- PuTTY terminal execution
- Hardware acceleration validation

Detailed setup instructions are available inside:

```text
docs/
```

